{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"6864961e-55df-48f2-9b68-16f82b94dbf6","level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"HeptaSync v1 — 語意與互動設計(白話版)"}]},{"type":"blockquote","attrs":{"id":"df7e1e19-82eb-4bc7-8b27-49d9ed53662e"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"0f14a802-148a-4985-8f2c-6fa390ad00ba"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"這張卡是 2026-05-22 一場設計討論的白話總結。完整、精確的版本在 repo 的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"v1/DESIGN.md"},{"type":"text","text":" §8。這裡只求好懂。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"e0d03bc0-6d0a-42cf-b77b-a5aaa7fd88b5","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一句話"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"4e84018e-c5b3-43fd-9e11-c75feb702056"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"HeptaSync 補的是官方 Heptabase CLI 缺的那一個動作:"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"「改寫一張已經存在的卡」"},{"type":"text","text":"。官方 CLI 只能新建卡、往卡的尾巴加東西,改不了中間。HeptaSync 就補這個洞。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"c631c558-d6f4-4d9e-b3ea-a63789efa8d2","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"怎麼用"}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"77ea1dda-b0de-4555-8d28-801cc1af02d1","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"47b9a466-918d-40b5-9ae2-cca22fd7ebb9"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"想改某張卡 → "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs pull"},{"type":"text","text":" 把它變成本地一個 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".md"},{"type":"text","text":" 檔。"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"3ccdd169-1fb2-4235-8440-395669456964","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"09125661-04da-4d69-a2f9-5fae82839add"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"像改一般文字檔一樣編輯它。"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"689c68d9-5400-4a2d-ba4a-f38c6143e1b8","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"a4170291-a492-48c1-a3a2-23e736006188"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs push"},{"type":"text","text":" 推回 Heptabase —— 還是同一張卡,身分不變。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"303e814c-6d9f-4c90-a8f6-0f1ca41815f2"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"找卡、建全新的卡,還是用官方 CLI 比較簡單;HeptaSync 專心做「改既有卡」這件事。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"11d1b376-d620-442a-af7f-3f440bdeb9f3","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"講定的幾件事"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"dd02c1b9-03ec-4dd5-b55a-9ae7b11295a2","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"同步"}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"32bd49bb-aa8a-470d-a4a0-843f3367e566","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ef2efe41-f67a-4b82-b1d0-fa3e11b5c2c6"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一個資料夾 = 一個 vault,綁在專案目錄(就像 git 的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".git/"},{"type":"text","text":")。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"2db85c1c-49b2-43b3-8181-8aa166b85e2c","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"2313cc6c-c715-43cd-9968-ea3339359856"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"卡片標題 = 內文第一行的 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"# 大標"},{"type":"text","text":"。改它就會改卡名,兩邊雙向。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"5c4810e0-5cd0-43d8-996e-9dcd39d7a4d0","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ae51dcfc-787e-4b28-882c-2bd0587b50b1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"檔名只是給人看的,工具"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"永遠不會自動改你的檔名"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"30c48a32-fb03-4371-9f7f-d3b90d79dd8b","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"3956c5e6-1e09-4b31-8f01-f8a8ec600d47"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"本地把檔案刪掉 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"不等於"},{"type":"text","text":" 刪卡片,只是「不再同步它」。要真的刪卡得明講 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs trash"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"6c5a095c-b320-46dc-863a-719b992bbc2b","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"52bf1e2f-5273-49c3-a744-7e52b6f1700a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"v1 只做 note 卡片;journal 跟白板暫時不碰。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"4f358260-cf91-4c16-bd2c-4b0876c3e725","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"動到真實資料時"}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"ea8485d6-6ed5-46d0-8ad6-9a91af1d1860","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"d36f6627-81c8-4b29-8b56-98f61bb8c053"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"單檔 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs push"},{"type":"text","text":" → 直接做,做完回報。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"30467787-39d6-4484-9d50-ed0528fcbd03","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"f774cdb3-1d01-4513-b219-c7833af9465c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"整批 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs sync"},{"type":"text","text":" → 先給你一份「會改哪些」的清單,你點頭才整批寫。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"fa4c198a-13d1-4b28-8c14-cc02ff9ab150","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"d9d2305b-e3fa-48a6-984a-7ab7c97280ef"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"平常安靜,只有「動到真資料 / 出狀況 / 要你決定」才開口。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"ee583d12-6ab2-40bc-8579-a7efd56878fc","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ed09ca7c-4154-4b30-9712-9dc0c76f17b7"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"卡片太大(超過 10 萬字)推不回去 → 停下來,建議切成兩張,你同意才切。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"ab2f224b-72cf-4354-aebe-f24cdf92515c","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"623f8164-74fa-4ca0-bcb8-7ed9a4e0262d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"你 pull 之後別人也改了同一張卡 → 工具把你的版本備份成 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".conflict.md"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"不會硬蓋掉"},{"type":"text","text":",然後告訴你。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"10677330-0002-47cd-bddd-33ea5f9a24ed","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tag"}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"8abad0c3-3cd0-47cb-9eac-4ba9c8597ea7","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"0055c29c-8413-43ea-8f8f-3d561409d0f5"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"新卡不主動問你要掛什麼 tag —— 你 frontmatter 寫什麼就掛什麼。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"4cab136e-8ece-4b33-9e02-ce05760d7fe3","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"539a2066-b100-41b6-a2b0-31bee84bdf51"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"打錯字會憑空生出垃圾 tag(而且 CLI 刪不掉)→ 工具發現「新 tag 長得很像某個舊 tag」會停下來問你。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"5d063640-d14c-46ad-b4bc-daa53735f70c","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ce6ba362-9bc3-489e-8bde-5f2f21a74b87"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"tag 同步用「三方比對」:你加的、你刪的、遠端自己多出來的,互相不會蓋掉。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"d6a20d17-530b-4d63-98c0-76dd36b9ef5a","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"檔案開頭那段隱藏設定(frontmatter)"}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"1c99811b-c9b7-4b68-bba9-9f7efed021d2","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ab511217-8e97-4e15-8374-ec977012c450"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"每個 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".md"},{"type":"text","text":" 開頭有一段 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"heptabase:"},{"type":"text","text":" 設定,記住這檔對應哪張卡。預覽 markdown 時看不到。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"bf6623d7-7714-451c-8579-ed5eecebd8f2","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"2657bfce-23ca-4d8d-a2f1-a61deab49349"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"你能自己改的只有 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"tags:"},{"type":"text","text":";其他欄位是工具管的,別手動動。"}]}]},{"type":"bullet_list_item","attrs":{"id":"0e908818-a34e-4dc6-a0f3-aab5fead73eb","folded":false,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"83aa51e2-8c47-4e6e-884c-1c5f7bcefc46"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"你寫一個全新的純 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":".md"},{"type":"text","text":" 直接 push,工具會自動幫你補上這段設定。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"d4920689-d273-4d36-811f-37f35c80d1e1","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚠️ 我覺得你還需要額外想的"}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"74048c05-7ecc-4eaf-8277-6b8069e8368a","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"c64fe019-c4eb-42b2-8efc-7688f21099fb"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"journal 沒進 v1,但 journal 可能才是你最常用的。"},{"type":"text","text":" 你每天在 Heptabase 寫 journal(LeetCode 紀錄那些)。journal 技術上跟 note 幾乎一樣、加進來很便宜。要想清楚:v1 切「只做 note」,是不是剛好把你最高頻的用途排除掉了?"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"95d6c5be-80f4-4f0c-b750-93990b16fcf2","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"3080e61a-b172-4bf2-92f9-40edbc723ac4"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"判斷邏輯要放程式裡,還是交給 Claude?"},{"type":"text","text":" 像「卡太大要不要切」「衝突怎麼辦」「tag 像不像」這些判斷,還沒決定是 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs"},{"type":"text","text":" 程式自己做,還是 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"hs"},{"type":"text","text":" 只負責回報、由 Claude 讀完再決定。這會大幅影響怎麼實作,值得先想。"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"90961d34-e219-49cb-8cdb-fd4b20b26dde","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"54952ffe-5779-4407-aa6d-2df9f749daea"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"同一張卡可能同時待在兩個 vault。"},{"type":"text","text":" 你選了「每個專案一個 vault」。代價是同一張卡被 pull 進專案 A 跟專案 B,兩邊各改會打架。工具靠衝突機制接住、不會掉資料,但用起來會煩 —— 想一下這在你身上會不會常發生。"}]}]},{"type":"numbered_list_item","attrs":{"id":"1c5ceaa8-067c-4db2-b35b-a95eb3d0ff88","order":null,"format":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"382111b5-4a9f-40e0-9e9b-4f5bcd0f7b18"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"strong"}],"text":"白板在 v1 是唯讀的。"},{"type":"text","text":" 你本來以為 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"whiteboards"},{"type":"text","text":" 欄位可以編輯,但 v1 不寫白板。確認一下你 OK 在 v1 沒有「用 frontmatter 把卡丟上白板」這個功能。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"9bcbe6ea-7247-41f7-9824-5a805e0843eb"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"hepta.sync"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"2c0fd3ec-7c80-412c-87c9-143143180a10"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"heptasync"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"c9d87afb-a107-4f24-ae74-b9ddd1ea417c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"hs"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"7192004a-ade8-4069-87f6-276bc46ef6c8"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"本地撞車測試行 — 我在本地加的。"}]}]}